he, ghosts hold grudges, and every choice could cost you your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step of your investigation is brought to life through engaging gameplay: from scouring atmospheric hidden object scenes to unlocking fresh challenges with original mini-games. Each puzzle is designed to keep you thinking, searching, and unraveling the mysteries piece by piece.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855990/extras/62638222b5597b289bfaf84bc47ec4be.poster.avif?t=1762945956\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855990/extras/62638222b5597b289bfaf84bc47ec4be.webm?t=1762945956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855990/extras/62638222b5597b289bfaf84bc47ec4be.mp4?t=1762945956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2e Immerse yourself in a rich blend of supernatural noir and detective mystery, set in 1950s Salem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2e Tackle dozens of unique puzzles and mini-games that test both logic and observation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2e Explore eerie streets, haunted places, and hidden corners of Salem as you pursue the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2e Collect hidden objects and uncover special collectibles along your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2e Shape the outcome of the investigation through meaningful choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2e Unlock achievements to mark your progress and skill.<br>\ud83d\udd2eEnjoy beautifully crafted artwork, enchanting wallpapers, and a hauntingly atmospheric soundtrack.<br><br>Step into the shadows, follow the clues, and uncover the truth behind Salem\u2019s most chilling legend. The ride is waiting \u2014 but will you survive it?</p>","developers":["Do Games Limited"],"dlc":[3856310],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855990/675a00b2242237a05e9a782cedd1a0b3db31edc3/header.jpg?t=1762945956","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11.0<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 MB RAM</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 15.0<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Silicon<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 MB RAM</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3855990/633691497/34dcf48ca2ba115ee9315295d7b25850f79a6131/1759834469/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759835163","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3855990/633691497/34dcf48ca2ba115ee9315295d7b25850f79a6131/1759834469/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759835163","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3855990/633691497/34dcf48ca2ba115ee9315295d7b25850f79a6131/1759834469/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759835163","id":257167701,"name":"Secrets of Salem: The Phantom Cab","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257167701/c7e633fcc7cb3dd7cc1aa0954fb03d372b06fb7b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759835163"}],"name":"Secrets of Salem: The Phantom Cab Collector's Edition","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Secrets of Salem: The Phantom Cab Collector's Edition - $11.99 USD","packageid":1355683,"percent_savings"